| # | Test | Smell | Severity | Core risk |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `Replenish_AsyncJob_Completes` | Sleepy Test | **High** | Slow + flaky CI; masks timing bugs |
| 2 | `Audit_RunsWithoutError` | Assertion-Free | **High** | Can never fail → false confidence |
| 3 | `Restock_FromSupplier_…` | Unexplained Skip | **Medium** | Silent test rot, no tracking |
| 4 | `Reserve_AcrossWarehouses_…` | Documented Skip | **Low** | Healthy pattern; just keep issue alive |
